WEBVTT

00:00:11.570 --> 00:00:15.990
<i>Our Orgonium output for this year
is set to exceed that of last year...</i>

00:00:16.370 --> 00:00:20.950
<i>and the importance of Bayron City
in the world has further increased...</i>

00:00:35.300 --> 00:00:38.300
I&S OFFICE
SHU OGATA

00:00:41.350 --> 00:00:43.770
I'm sorry I couldn't drop by lately.

00:00:43.770 --> 00:00:46.400
My final exams were this week.

00:00:46.400 --> 00:00:49.480
I'm sure you were just buying bento
from the convenience store, right?

00:00:49.480 --> 00:00:53.990
Shu, when I'm not with you,
you really are...

00:01:05.620 --> 00:01:08.250
NO MLMS OR
SOLICITATION
ALLOWED!
CHAGALL CAFÉ

00:01:06.250 --> 00:01:08.250
It's a very simple contract!

00:01:08.830 --> 00:01:14.420
We'll be doing negotiations
with the other party and all that for you.

00:01:09.880 --> 00:01:14.420
EPISODE 1
A LOSER AND A DEMON
AND A MAN AND A WOMAN

00:01:14.670 --> 00:01:15.340
But...

00:01:15.630 --> 00:01:18.260
I'd like to consult my friends first.

00:01:23.020 --> 00:01:25.270
Hey, Shu, are you eating properly?

00:01:25.270 --> 00:01:28.150
I'm eating right now
for the first time in three days.

00:01:28.150 --> 00:01:29.610
How's your work going?

00:01:29.610 --> 00:01:32.730
I told you it's going well
when you look at the big picture.

00:01:33.690 --> 00:01:35.650
How long ago did you last work?

00:01:36.950 --> 00:01:39.240
Just a little bit ago...

00:01:39.240 --> 00:01:42.620
when you think
about the length of human life.

00:01:43.830 --> 00:01:48.250
That's why I told you. You were showing off
and decided to go off on your own,

00:01:48.250 --> 00:01:51.380
but it's all for nothing if you can't
keep putting food on the table.

00:01:54.170 --> 00:01:55.340
Even then...

00:01:55.920 --> 00:01:59.720
I've made up my mind to only do the jobs
I should be doing from now on.

00:02:00.050 --> 00:02:03.100
Just how long are you going to be
clinging to the past?

00:02:01.140 --> 00:02:03.100
Okay. Sign here.

00:02:03.100 --> 00:02:05.520
Don't have such
a backward way of thinking,

00:02:05.520 --> 00:02:09.140
and think more about the future!
It's your life, isn't it?

00:02:09.140 --> 00:02:13.110
I'll decide for myself what is the past
and what is the future for me.

00:02:16.490 --> 00:02:17.610
Oh...

00:02:17.610 --> 00:02:19.780
J-J-Just like you said, Ayano,

00:02:19.780 --> 00:02:21.950
it's my life.

00:02:23.580 --> 00:02:26.040
B-But... that's especially why...

00:02:27.370 --> 00:02:31.040
This is what I decided
when I quit your company.

00:02:32.250 --> 00:02:34.880
I'll give it everything I've got
by myself for that purpose.

00:02:34.880 --> 00:02:37.970
And even if I starve to death
or die in solitude...

00:02:38.340 --> 00:02:40.050
I won't regret it.

00:02:40.050 --> 00:02:41.300
But...

00:02:42.220 --> 00:02:44.470
you're not all by yourself right now.

00:02:45.180 --> 00:02:47.180
It looks like someone is feeding you.

00:02:48.060 --> 00:02:51.440
No matter how I look at it,
you won't be dying in solitude—

00:02:53.110 --> 00:02:56.360
All right! Work talk for the first time in a while!
Let's kick this off with a blast!

00:03:01.990 --> 00:03:03.660
You think they'll take this on?

00:03:03.660 --> 00:03:05.030
We'll consider it.

00:03:05.030 --> 00:03:07.240
If this information is real.

00:03:07.830 --> 00:03:11.920
Let's see. Spaghetti and a sandwich, so—

00:03:10.160 --> 00:03:11.920
You can stop posing like that.

00:03:12.210 --> 00:03:13.170
Oh?

00:03:15.840 --> 00:03:17.920
Then, please consider it.

00:03:19.590 --> 00:03:21.130
Oh, hey!

00:03:22.340 --> 00:03:25.720
Can I contact you next time?

00:03:27.720 --> 00:03:29.180
I don't mind.

00:03:30.560 --> 00:03:31.690
But...

00:03:31.690 --> 00:03:32.770
But?

00:03:33.520 --> 00:03:36.520
IMPORTANT

00:03:33.520 --> 00:03:36.520
MR. SHU OGATA

00:03:33.850 --> 00:03:36.520
Actually, I haven't been paying
my cellphone bill.

00:03:36.520 --> 00:03:38.110
And they might stop service
as soon as tomorrow—

00:03:38.110 --> 00:03:39.190
Gimme that invoice!

00:03:39.190 --> 00:03:41.240
I'm terribly sorry about this!

00:04:01.970 --> 00:04:03.590
Welcome back.

00:04:09.640 --> 00:04:11.140
You're late, Shu.

00:04:11.140 --> 00:04:15.270
Sorry, but please don't quietly wait for me
in the dark! It's so scary, it might kill me!

00:04:15.270 --> 00:04:18.690
I had a really hard time.
I couldn't use anything electric.

00:04:18.940 --> 00:04:21.570
But you were able to do this much.

00:04:21.570 --> 00:04:24.610
I tried really hard!
I tried really hard, you know!

00:04:24.610 --> 00:04:26.320
Y-Yeah.

00:04:26.320 --> 00:04:28.700
So, let's have dinner!

00:04:28.700 --> 00:04:31.120
Oh, well, sorry.

00:04:31.120 --> 00:04:33.460
I just ate out.

00:04:34.250 --> 00:04:35.620
I see.

00:04:35.620 --> 00:04:37.250
Right.

00:04:37.710 --> 00:04:40.800
Y-Yeah, there's nothing
I could've done about that.

00:04:40.800 --> 00:04:43.170
I'm doing all this
without you asking me to.

00:04:43.170 --> 00:04:46.220
Oh, sorry! I just haven't been eating
at home for a while!

00:04:46.220 --> 00:04:48.470
Actually, I haven't been eating
anything at all.

00:04:50.600 --> 00:04:52.770
I'm sorry! It's all my fault!

00:04:52.770 --> 00:04:57.520
I couldn't drop by for a while, and having
exams at school won't even be a good excuse!

00:04:57.520 --> 00:05:00.520
Then I don't have to tell you that, right?
Why am I telling you this?

00:05:00.520 --> 00:05:04.950
Of course you'd forget about me!
I don't deserve to stay alive! I'm so hopeless!

00:05:05.450 --> 00:05:06.450
I'll have some!

00:05:06.450 --> 00:05:08.780
I'll totally eat all of it!

00:05:11.830 --> 00:05:12.830
Is it tasty?

00:05:12.830 --> 00:05:13.750
It's col—

00:05:13.750 --> 00:05:15.830
Oh, it's tasty! Very!

00:05:15.830 --> 00:05:17.420
I'm glad!

00:05:17.420 --> 00:05:22.920
Anyways, if you were having trouble putting food
on the table, you should've told me earlier.

00:05:22.920 --> 00:05:26.180
Well, you did say
that you had exams this week.

00:05:26.180 --> 00:05:30.550
With no upcoming work, I felt bad
about calling you over for something like this.

00:05:30.550 --> 00:05:31.640
Jeez.

00:05:31.640 --> 00:05:35.730
Shu, the bad thing about you
is that you're too kind.

00:05:40.520 --> 00:05:42.190
Oh, okay.

00:05:42.440 --> 00:05:45.820
I'm glad you worried about me,

00:05:46.110 --> 00:05:48.450
but you don't have to be so considerate.

00:05:48.700 --> 00:05:51.580
R-Right.

00:05:54.330 --> 00:05:56.580
Because I know...

00:05:56.870 --> 00:06:00.880
that you can really get things done, Shu.

00:06:01.130 --> 00:06:05.420
If you really put your heart into it, as a genius,
you'll never lose against anyone!

00:06:05.420 --> 00:06:07.630
Th-Thanks for the compliment!

00:06:07.630 --> 00:06:09.260
Huh? What's this?

00:06:09.550 --> 00:06:11.890
I smell the scent of another woman!

00:06:12.180 --> 00:06:14.060
I went out into the city after all!

00:06:14.060 --> 00:06:17.390
And I might've bumped
into a woman while I was out!

00:06:19.480 --> 00:06:22.730
At least they didn't stop the water.

00:06:22.730 --> 00:06:25.400
That said, I need to do
something about this soon.

00:06:25.400 --> 00:06:27.150
It'll start hindering my work.

00:06:27.440 --> 00:06:30.160
You're fine!
I made payments for you just now.

00:06:30.570 --> 00:06:33.910
The electricity should be back
tomorrow or the day after that.

00:06:33.910 --> 00:06:35.790
Wait. You okay with that?

00:06:36.250 --> 00:06:40.250
Yeah. I still have enough savings to pay
about a month's worth of living expenses.

00:06:40.710 --> 00:06:44.380
But you worked really hard for that money.

00:06:44.800 --> 00:06:45.840
It's fine.

00:06:45.840 --> 00:06:49.180
I have no ways to use money anyway.

00:06:49.180 --> 00:06:51.680
If it can be of use to you...

00:06:53.850 --> 00:06:54.810
I see.

00:06:55.350 --> 00:06:56.970
That's great.

00:06:56.970 --> 00:06:57.980
Huh?

00:06:58.560 --> 00:06:59.390
Oh...

00:07:01.100 --> 00:07:02.100
Hello!

00:07:02.100 --> 00:07:04.440
Bayron City Express!

00:07:04.980 --> 00:07:07.900
I actually ordered something COD,

00:07:07.900 --> 00:07:11.280
but I thought I'd have to cancel the order
because I didn't have any money!

00:07:12.410 --> 00:07:13.910
What?

00:07:17.450 --> 00:07:21.710
It's all over! Both of us, penniless?
We can't keep living anymore!

00:07:22.830 --> 00:07:26.800
The only option is for both of us to take
some medicine and head over to Heaven.

00:07:24.210 --> 00:07:26.170
87 Posts
1 Follower
4 Following

00:07:28.050 --> 00:07:29.920
1 LIKE
#wewillbetogetherforeverinthekingdom

00:07:28.920 --> 00:07:32.050
No matter how hard I think
about it, we can't go to Heaven!

00:07:32.050 --> 00:07:35.050
Thank you, my one and only follower.

00:07:35.470 --> 00:07:37.970
I'm sorry I can't properly
give you a goodbye.

00:07:37.970 --> 00:07:40.980
I told you, I'll give the money back
as soon as I get some work.

00:07:41.390 --> 00:07:44.940
You say that, but you haven't worked
at all for three months.

00:07:45.520 --> 00:07:48.900
There have been auctions,
but you never even try to win them.

00:07:48.900 --> 00:07:50.440
Just you watch.

00:07:50.440 --> 00:07:51.950
It should be coming soon.

00:07:51.950 --> 00:07:54.820
Subject: About the case you inquired
About the D Hazard
which occurred at 15:55 today at
the Legeston Hotel Bayron.
We report to you
that 4 out of the 5
conditions your office
designated were met.

00:07:52.400 --> 00:07:54.820
That case I've been looking for.

00:07:54.820 --> 00:07:58.040
You told me that last month
and the month before that.

00:07:58.040 --> 00:07:59.870
We'll be definitely fine this time!

00:07:59.870 --> 00:08:03.750
I pitched in all of my living expenses
for this month to get a hold of some intel!

00:08:05.080 --> 00:08:06.210
Here it comes!

00:08:26.310 --> 00:08:27.730
Ananda LAB Director
Kaya Ananda

00:08:27.730 --> 00:08:29.230
PANZER Craft War Chief
Bruno Krauser

00:08:27.730 --> 00:08:29.230
Kennel Animaroid - Dominic Kennel

00:08:29.230 --> 00:08:30.730
THE GUTS Leader
The Justice

00:08:29.230 --> 00:08:30.730
JADEITE
Company
CEO
Rob Skyrunner

00:08:30.730 --> 00:08:32.240
AAA Defender Co. President
Akino Yugiri

00:08:32.240 --> 00:08:33.860
I&S Office
Shu Ogata

00:08:33.860 --> 00:08:36.030
Anti-Demon Bureau Chief
Masaaki Ashiya

00:08:35.160 --> 00:08:36.030
All right.

00:08:36.030 --> 00:08:41.040
The time has come, so I'll begin the briefing session.

00:08:47.460 --> 00:08:51.550
Then, this is a single perpetrator for sure?
What does he want?

00:08:51.550 --> 00:08:52.510
Hmm...

00:08:52.510 --> 00:08:56.800
Come to think of it, he may have been moaning
about something in the beginning.

00:08:57.800 --> 00:08:59.810
Officer Morgan, go ahead.

00:09:04.060 --> 00:09:04.690
Wha...

00:09:09.940 --> 00:09:11.730
H-Hey, what in the world is that—

00:09:11.730 --> 00:09:17.280
Well, as we deal in things of such nature,
we do have our own means of security.

00:09:17.620 --> 00:09:21.240
So troublesome! If it was a human,
this would be irrecoverable!

00:09:21.240 --> 00:09:24.750
So that thing is not a human after all!

00:10:03.240 --> 00:10:04.330
D Hazard has occurred!

00:10:04.830 --> 00:10:05.870
After everyone has evacuated...

00:10:06.210 --> 00:10:07.330
seal the venue!

00:10:07.620 --> 00:10:09.120
Right, that!

00:10:09.120 --> 00:10:13.750
I finally understand the meaning of "D Hazard"
that you investigators sometimes mention!

00:10:14.090 --> 00:10:16.170
The "D" is referring to "Demon"!

00:10:16.170 --> 00:10:18.760
So demons have infiltrated this city—

00:10:18.760 --> 00:10:21.010
This is no time to be impressed!

00:10:30.520 --> 00:10:33.570
That concludes the summary
for the case in question.

00:10:33.900 --> 00:10:37.320
That said, the request
for this case is as follows.

00:10:37.320 --> 00:10:41.450
First, disable the suspect.
It doesn't matter if the suspect is dead or alive.

00:10:39.200 --> 00:10:41.450
Name: No Data
Gender: Male
Address: No Data
Occupation: No Data
Request Summary: Dead or Alive
Estimated Class: C

00:10:41.910 --> 00:10:45.330
A C-Class. Looks like a job we can make
good money for the first time in a while.

00:10:45.620 --> 00:10:47.080
Have you identified the suspect?

00:10:47.080 --> 00:10:48.750
Not as of yet.

00:10:48.750 --> 00:10:52.250
Likely one of the regulars at said casino.

00:10:52.250 --> 00:10:55.960
If he just wanted his money back,
he went too far.

00:10:56.260 --> 00:10:59.130
Are there any injured
that have been left behind?

00:10:59.130 --> 00:11:00.470
Nothing to worry about on that end.

00:11:00.470 --> 00:11:03.640
Everyone has been evacuated,
so you won't need to worry.

00:11:04.390 --> 00:11:07.520
So there won't be any problems
making a flashy thrashing!

00:11:07.520 --> 00:11:08.850
But that's not the case.

00:11:08.850 --> 00:11:09.480
Huh?

00:11:09.770 --> 00:11:14.400
There's an additional request to make sure
to limit the amount of secondary damage.

00:11:14.400 --> 00:11:17.320
The venue is located
at the center of the entertainment district,

00:11:17.320 --> 00:11:21.990
so if it were to be completely decimated,
it'd have detrimental effects to its surroundings.

00:11:21.990 --> 00:11:25.200
Also, the venue is the lowest floor
of a building, so...

00:11:25.200 --> 00:11:28.500
If you act too flamboyantly,
and break through into the ocean...

00:11:28.500 --> 00:11:32.000
...the entire city might sink.

00:11:32.880 --> 00:11:35.790
We will begin bids now.

00:11:35.790 --> 00:11:40.050
Cutoff is 10 minutes from now right at 7 PM.

00:11:40.800 --> 00:11:42.050
D HAZARD COUNTERMEASURE CORPORATIONS
BEGIN BIDDING

00:11:52.900 --> 00:11:54.650
D HAZARD COUNTERMEASURE CORPORATIONS
END BIDDING

00:11:55.020 --> 00:11:57.320
Announcing the results.

00:12:00.320 --> 00:12:00.990
FORFEIT

00:12:04.570 --> 00:12:07.790
The winning bid is $39,800.

00:12:07.790 --> 00:12:08.540
Huh?

00:12:08.870 --> 00:12:13.420
The winning company is I&S Office.

00:12:14.960 --> 00:12:19.170
Then, please get to your
countermeasures immediately.

00:12:20.760 --> 00:12:22.550
Oh, hello there!

00:12:22.550 --> 00:12:24.890
Thanks for all your hard work!

00:12:24.890 --> 00:12:26.050
You again?

00:12:26.050 --> 00:12:28.810
I thought you were behaving lately.

00:12:28.810 --> 00:12:30.220
You're kidding me!

00:12:30.220 --> 00:12:34.650
We're facing a C-Class! At that price, it's not
even worth killing some D-Class or lower nobody!

00:12:35.020 --> 00:12:37.570
Bidding is a free-for-all competition, right?

00:12:37.570 --> 00:12:41.570
A job like this is like a simple exercise
after a meal for me.

00:12:41.900 --> 00:12:43.320
You market crasher!

00:12:43.320 --> 00:12:49.990
Realize already that crappy companies like you
are worsening the security of this city!

00:12:50.290 --> 00:12:51.450
Jeez!

00:12:51.450 --> 00:12:53.370
Be mindful in the future.

00:12:57.210 --> 00:13:01.010
Makes sense considering
what kind of person your father was.

00:13:04.220 --> 00:13:06.260
<i>You put up quite the front there.</i>

00:13:06.260 --> 00:13:08.470
I'm sorry, Boss.

00:13:08.470 --> 00:13:11.930
<i>Right now, you are
your own boss, aren't you?</i>

00:13:12.730 --> 00:13:15.730
<i>So, we proceed from here
according to that proposition?</i>

00:13:16.310 --> 00:13:19.110
Yes. I'll make sure
to deal with the main target.

00:13:19.110 --> 00:13:21.650
I'd like you for backup
and preventing damages to the surroundings.

00:13:21.650 --> 00:13:25.650
<i>All right. I'll take 35,000 on our end.</i>

00:13:26.320 --> 00:13:29.830
I'm sorry,
but that's over 80% of the bid.

00:13:29.830 --> 00:13:32.540
<i>That's only because you're doing
some reckless dumping on your end.</i>

00:13:32.910 --> 00:13:37.290
<i>It's quite a bargain if you think about
all the money my daughter has poured into you.</i>

00:13:37.290 --> 00:13:40.210
You call something like that
"a negative spiral"—

00:13:41.460 --> 00:13:43.380
The deal's done.

00:13:43.380 --> 00:13:44.760
I was listening.

00:13:44.760 --> 00:13:48.050
So stick with supporting
just like how he wants it.

00:13:48.050 --> 00:13:49.300
I get it.

00:13:49.640 --> 00:13:50.720
Also...

00:13:51.140 --> 00:13:51.970
Hmm?

00:13:52.350 --> 00:13:55.350
...don't bring me into the picture
each and every time, Mom!

00:13:55.350 --> 00:13:58.310
I have nothing to do with him anymore!

00:13:59.730 --> 00:14:00.980
I'm surprised...

00:14:01.480 --> 00:14:03.900
you can sound so pretentious.

00:14:08.820 --> 00:14:10.240
Well, I'm heading out now.

00:14:10.910 --> 00:14:13.910
I'll return that money
I borrowed by tomorrow.

00:14:26.380 --> 00:14:27.220
You're late!

00:14:27.220 --> 00:14:29.970
Well, the monorail was running late.

00:14:29.970 --> 00:14:31.800
Use a taxi! A cab!

00:14:32.350 --> 00:14:35.270
You know I don't have money
to do stuff like that.

00:14:36.140 --> 00:14:37.180
What's the plan?

00:14:37.180 --> 00:14:40.810
As always, I'll only signal
for stopping and resuming attack.

00:14:40.810 --> 00:14:42.520
All other decisions are at your discretion.

00:14:42.860 --> 00:14:45.650
If we defeat the main target,
we'll take the whole sum.

00:14:46.030 --> 00:14:47.240
It's okay.

00:14:47.240 --> 00:14:49.490
Only we can defeat that thing.

00:14:53.780 --> 00:14:57.160
Of course, you're totally prepared for this.

00:14:57.500 --> 00:15:00.670
You've already summoned
all of your minions, too.

00:15:01.380 --> 00:15:04.420
Then, just like our plan,
I'm counting on you to deal with the minions!

00:15:29.820 --> 00:15:31.860
We'll keep at it and draw enemy attention!

00:15:31.860 --> 00:15:32.620
Roger!

00:15:57.520 --> 00:15:59.730
Of course it wouldn't work!

00:16:00.020 --> 00:16:00.680
Hold...

00:16:00.680 --> 00:16:02.520
up!

00:16:10.690 --> 00:16:11.570
Shu!

00:16:26.210 --> 00:16:28.800
You're finally not mad at me anymore.

00:16:29.090 --> 00:16:30.800
I can't help it.

00:16:30.800 --> 00:16:34.130
Shu, you can't do anything without me.

00:16:35.180 --> 00:16:36.550
That is indeed correct!

00:16:36.550 --> 00:16:38.060
I'm terribly sorry!

00:16:38.350 --> 00:16:41.140
Without Miss Kisara, I am nothing
but a rock on the roadside...

00:16:40.060 --> 00:16:41.140
Captain!

00:16:41.480 --> 00:16:42.390
Look at that!

00:16:43.350 --> 00:16:45.190
It even regenerates!

00:16:45.690 --> 00:16:48.860
If it has regenerative powers,
it would be deemed "B-Class."

00:16:49.230 --> 00:16:50.940
We should ask for some backup.

00:16:50.940 --> 00:16:52.820
We don't have the budget for that!

00:16:52.820 --> 00:16:53.700
Besides...

00:16:54.360 --> 00:16:58.330
it frustrates me, but as long as she's around,
that thing's no enemy against us.

00:16:59.240 --> 00:17:00.580
Kisara, I'm counting on you!

00:17:00.580 --> 00:17:03.080
I wanna get through here
and get as close to it as I can!

00:17:03.080 --> 00:17:04.250
Okay, got it!

00:17:14.340 --> 00:17:15.970
Whaaaaat?

00:17:16.300 --> 00:17:18.760
Hold on! What's going on here?

00:17:18.760 --> 00:17:20.560
No more power...

00:17:20.560 --> 00:17:22.350
That was just one swing!

00:17:22.350 --> 00:17:27.230
I mean, we haven't been working
for three months now.

00:17:27.610 --> 00:17:30.730
So we haven't done the ritual
for three months.

00:17:32.360 --> 00:17:35.740
Ayano, I'm sorry, can you buy us
just a little bit of time?

00:17:36.070 --> 00:17:37.530
Hurry up and get it done!

00:17:39.580 --> 00:17:40.990
Shu...

00:17:41.410 --> 00:17:45.370
Kisara, I want to defeat him at any cost.

00:17:45.710 --> 00:17:46.870
Yeah.

00:17:46.870 --> 00:17:51.130
And to do that,
I need your powers at any cost.

00:17:52.130 --> 00:17:53.510
Are we going to?

00:17:53.800 --> 00:17:55.760
W-W-Well, yeah.

00:17:57.130 --> 00:18:00.720
This means I'm going to be powered up
with the strength of our love!

00:18:01.220 --> 00:18:04.850
Oh, um, I think the nuance is slightly off, but...

00:18:04.850 --> 00:18:06.230
Close your eyes.

00:18:06.810 --> 00:18:09.190
Can you be gentle, if you could—

00:18:22.660 --> 00:18:23.660
Hey!

00:18:23.660 --> 00:18:25.540
How long are you going to make us wait?

00:19:13.630 --> 00:19:14.920
Where are you aiming at?

00:19:15.250 --> 00:19:16.260
I missed.

00:19:16.260 --> 00:19:17.590
Wait, you were aiming at me?

00:19:17.590 --> 00:19:21.640
A useless old woman is nothing
but an obstruction even simply by existing.

00:19:21.640 --> 00:19:23.550
What was that?

00:19:27.600 --> 00:19:29.100
Where's this?

00:19:29.100 --> 00:19:31.150
What the hell happened to me?

00:19:33.610 --> 00:19:36.110
MID-BATTLE!

00:19:36.400 --> 00:19:37.860
To begin with...

00:19:37.860 --> 00:19:40.360
I didn't know you were someone
who worked in this industry!

00:19:40.700 --> 00:19:44.120
He groveled down and begged,
so I'm reluctantly helping out!

00:19:48.790 --> 00:19:53.290
That reminds me, Shu had the smell
of some woman when he came home.

00:19:53.290 --> 00:19:55.380
He fudged the answer back then, but...

00:19:56.880 --> 00:20:00.470
Thieving cats really do spawn everywhere!

00:20:02.050 --> 00:20:03.890
If you're so worried...

00:20:05.850 --> 00:20:09.270
chain him up and make sure
he doesn't step outside at all!

00:20:11.140 --> 00:20:12.140
Huh?

00:20:27.700 --> 00:20:30.450
Wait, what exactly are you two doing?

00:20:30.830 --> 00:20:35.460
Um, I didn't give you power
so that you could do some infighting!

00:20:35.460 --> 00:20:38.340
But Shu...

00:20:38.340 --> 00:20:40.670
I've been holding back until now!

00:20:40.010 --> 00:20:43.470
Can we talk about your dissatisfactions
and desires at some other time?

00:20:43.470 --> 00:20:48.760
But Shu, at home, you always say
you're tired or we'll do it tomorrow!

00:20:48.760 --> 00:20:51.640
You always make excuses
to dodge the issue!

00:20:49.600 --> 00:20:53.440
I'll lend an ear tomorrow! Let's talk about it
when this battle's over! Okay? Right?

00:20:53.440 --> 00:20:54.310
Should I shoot them?

00:20:54.310 --> 00:20:56.190
Don't waste time dealing
with the likes of them!

00:21:03.740 --> 00:21:07.240
Then, present to me
the proof of our contract.

00:21:07.830 --> 00:21:10.370
Th-That would be...

00:21:11.870 --> 00:21:13.210
A spare key.

00:21:13.710 --> 00:21:14.460
Huh?

00:21:14.460 --> 00:21:16.960
A spare key for your place, Shu!

00:21:17.540 --> 00:21:18.960
You don't need such a thing.

00:21:19.550 --> 00:21:21.760
You can go through the wall to enter.

00:21:22.510 --> 00:21:24.340
It's not about that!

00:21:24.340 --> 00:21:26.800
It's not about that at all!

00:21:37.610 --> 00:21:38.360
Ten!

00:21:39.900 --> 00:21:40.980
Nine!

00:21:41.650 --> 00:21:42.740
Eight!

00:21:43.440 --> 00:21:44.360
Seven!

00:21:45.150 --> 00:21:46.200
Six!

00:21:46.990 --> 00:21:47.780
Five!

00:21:49.200 --> 00:21:49.950
Four!

00:21:51.830 --> 00:21:52.700
Three!

00:21:54.160 --> 00:21:55.210
Two!

00:21:56.580 --> 00:21:57.460
One!

00:22:01.880 --> 00:22:03.130
Zero!

00:22:14.640 --> 00:22:19.310
20:45
COUNTERMEASURES
COMPLETE

00:22:25.690 --> 00:22:27.200
Are you okay?

00:22:27.200 --> 00:22:29.410
I guess.

00:22:29.990 --> 00:22:31.950
It's over, right?

00:22:32.330 --> 00:22:34.410
Yeah, it's over.

00:22:36.120 --> 00:22:38.040
Before that...

00:22:38.750 --> 00:22:40.040
here you go.

00:22:40.880 --> 00:22:43.300
Oh? You give me no choice.

00:22:46.670 --> 00:22:47.680
What do you see?

00:22:47.680 --> 00:22:48.930
Don't rush it.

00:22:49.260 --> 00:22:51.390
I'll take my time to tell you in bed.

00:22:57.810 --> 00:22:59.140
This means...

00:22:59.140 --> 00:23:01.690
Well, we did break the floor.

00:23:01.690 --> 00:23:03.190
This isn't good!

00:23:03.190 --> 00:23:05.440
Right! We should get out of here soon!

00:23:05.440 --> 00:23:08.900
If there are any secondary damage,
they'll deduct from the reward money!

00:23:08.900 --> 00:23:10.410
You're worried about that?

00:23:39.100 --> 00:23:41.690
A B-Class doesn't have a chance.

00:23:43.020 --> 00:23:47.440
After all, we have a super
A-Class Demon Hazard on our side.

00:23:55.580 --> 00:24:00.000
EPISODE 2
THE ISLAND OF DESIRE

00:23:56.700 --> 00:23:59.080
"The Island of Desire."
